## 4) Deployment patterns

### Simple (single consumer)
{Airflow | Spark | dbt | Crawler} ──HTTP──▶ Marquez ─▶ Marquez UI

### Scalable fan-out (Kafka bus)
{Airflow | Spark | dbt | Crawler} ──▶ Kafka
     ├─▶ Marquez (stores + UI)
     ├─▶ Governance tool
     └─▶ Observability

### Distributor hub (Fluentd/Vector)
Producers ─HTTP──▶ Collector
         ├─HTTP──▶ Marquez
         └─▶ Kafka

